WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.817 --> 01:30.737
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.656 --> 01:33.991
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.867 --> 01:35.910
Black Jack.

01:48.864 --> 01:52.074
Originally by Tezuka "Two Love"

01:48.864 --> 01:52.074
The Miracle Arms

02:19.102 --> 02:20.770
Oh, Doc!

02:21.813 --> 02:23.481
Looks like you're done with the cleaning.

02:23.482 --> 02:25.357
I'm hungry.

02:25.358 --> 02:26.317
Let's go out.

02:26.318 --> 02:26.942
To where?

02:27.235 --> 02:30.279
Since you cleaned so well, I'll feed you something good.

02:30.530 --> 02:32.782
Then I want some parfait!

02:32.783 --> 02:34.482
No, something better.

02:34.659 --> 02:36.160
Something better?

02:36.161 --> 02:37.154
Steak? Anmitsu?

02:36.161 --> 02:37.154
Anmitsu is a sweet Japanese dessert.

02:37.996 --> 02:39.663
Just get ready.

02:39.734 --> 02:40.247
OK!

02:46.421 --> 02:48.005
Yum!

02:48.006 --> 02:51.890
Both the fish and arch shells are so smooth.

02:52.010 --> 02:54.095
The sushi Taku makes is second to none.

02:54.096 --> 02:56.305
Really, it's the best in the whole world.

02:56.723 --> 02:59.433
Doctor, don't flatter me so much.

02:59.434 --> 03:00.559
I'm serious.

03:01.103 --> 03:03.646
In that case, this one is on me.

03:04.773 --> 03:07.066
I love eggs!

03:07.067 --> 03:09.026
Go ahead and eat.

03:09.027 --> 03:10.361
Thank you!

03:13.589 --> 03:14.482
Yummy!

03:14.536 --> 03:15.349
I'm so happy!

03:15.951 --> 03:18.953
Master, I'm glad that you found a new chef.

03:19.246 --> 03:21.539
Yes, thank you.

03:22.122 --> 03:26.968
Sign: Noh Sushi

03:23.250 --> 03:24.166
Thank you!

03:24.167 --> 03:26.252
Thank you very a much!

03:27.754 --> 03:29.880
They're very unique people.

03:29.881 --> 03:33.050
He's a genius surgeon.

03:33.051 --> 03:33.843
A doctor?

03:34.040 --> 03:34.756
Yes.

03:34.928 --> 03:38.806
Our master was saved by one of his operations once.

03:39.141 --> 03:41.851
I'm sure he's the best doctor in Japan.

03:44.813 --> 03:48.107
Master, I'd like to ask something.

03:48.108 --> 03:48.974
What is it?

03:49.276 --> 03:50.852
Can I take a vacation?

03:51.027 --> 03:52.778
I'd like to go home.

03:52.779 --> 03:54.363
You finally feel up to it?

03:54.489 --> 03:56.323
Yes, finally.

03:56.742 --> 03:58.159
It's been 10 years.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.326
It took a long time.

04:00.704 --> 04:03.539
I won't go home until I master it.

04:04.040 --> 04:05.958
I promised my mother...

04:05.959 --> 04:09.503
that I would let her eat the best sushi
in Japan the next time I came home.

04:10.589 --> 04:15.968
It was probably your devotion to
your blind mother that drove you.

04:17.262 --> 04:19.847
You continued tirelessly to train yourself,

04:20.474 --> 04:24.560
and completed training in a few years,
whereas others would take 10 years.

04:28.607 --> 04:31.317
I'm proud to have such a talented apprentice.

04:31.985 --> 04:34.236
Take your time at home with your mother.

04:34.404 --> 04:36.530
Thank you, Master.

04:49.336 --> 04:52.505
<i>I'm sure Mom will be surprised by my visit.</i>

04:54.466 --> 04:59.887
Mom, I'll let you eat the best sushi
when I come home next time.

04:59.888 --> 05:04.517
I believe that you will become a great sushi chef.

05:04.518 --> 05:05.893
I'll be waiting.

05:11.650 --> 05:13.943
Good luck, Taku.

05:14.778 --> 05:15.986
<i>Mom...</i>

05:40.387 --> 05:41.053
No!

05:41.930 --> 05:42.930
Oh, man!

05:42.931 --> 05:44.807
Isn't that Taku-yan of Noh Sushi?!

05:44.808 --> 05:46.475
Somebody call the master!

05:49.771 --> 05:51.230
Arima Akira.

05:51.231 --> 05:53.274
Your occupation is a truck driver.

05:53.371 --> 05:53.909
Yes.

05:54.109 --> 05:55.025
No criminal record.

05:55.026 --> 05:57.361
No accident or tickets...You're an exemplary driver.

05:57.362 --> 05:59.822
What happened to the victim?

06:00.866 --> 06:03.993
He is alive, but both of his arms have been amputated.

06:04.619 --> 06:06.162
Amputated both arms?

06:06.163 --> 06:09.707
The damage was so great that
they couldn't do anything else.

06:10.417 --> 06:11.917
Amputated both arms...

06:12.127 --> 06:14.879
The victim was a highly skilled sushi chef.

06:15.839 --> 06:17.506
He was unlucky.

06:23.221 --> 06:24.180
Come in.

06:26.099 --> 06:27.099
Honey!

06:27.851 --> 06:28.559
Honey!

06:28.560 --> 06:31.353
Ritsuko, I've done something terrible.

06:31.646 --> 06:32.688
I've heard about it.

06:32.689 --> 06:34.188
But don't agonize so much.

06:34.399 --> 06:35.316
Please.

06:35.525 --> 06:38.360
I ruined a man's life.

06:39.488 --> 06:41.030
I ruined it!

06:44.242 --> 06:45.409
Honey...

06:49.873 --> 06:50.831
Ready!

06:54.252 --> 06:55.377
No good.

06:57.172 --> 06:59.340
What's up with those piles of omelettes?

06:59.341 --> 07:00.800
All failures!

07:00.801 --> 07:01.717
Failures?

07:02.094 --> 07:05.471
Doc, please! Take me to that sushi restaurant again!

07:05.740 --> 07:08.057
Oh, I see.

07:08.058 --> 07:10.184
No. We just went there.

07:10.394 --> 07:13.979
Besides, no amateur could copy that omelette so easily.

07:13.980 --> 07:15.564
It's a waste of eggs. Stop it now.

07:21.029 --> 07:22.405
Hey, you're gonna make more?!

07:22.406 --> 07:25.032
I'll try until I can!

07:31.915 --> 07:34.291
Oh, Noh Sushi? I'd like to make a reservation.

07:35.794 --> 07:36.836
What did you say?!

07:37.963 --> 07:39.713
I see. I understand.

07:40.507 --> 07:41.632
How did it go?

07:42.300 --> 07:43.509
We're canceling the sushi.

07:43.969 --> 07:45.970
Chef Taku was in an accident.

07:46.596 --> 07:48.931
Ohmigewdness!

07:49.349 --> 07:51.726
Not only that, he lost both of his arms.

08:03.238 --> 08:04.321
Yes.

08:09.786 --> 08:11.454
I'm Arima's wife.

08:11.455 --> 08:14.373
I'm at a loss for words as to how I could apologize...

08:15.000 --> 08:18.252
My husband is in jail right now, unable to come here.

08:18.253 --> 08:20.528
But I will do all I can...

08:20.528 --> 08:21.464
Please go home.

08:21.965 --> 08:22.965
But...

08:22.966 --> 08:24.925
There is nothing to talk about.

08:25.260 --> 08:26.969
Please go home.

08:28.013 --> 08:29.346
I understand.

08:29.347 --> 08:31.307
I will come back some other day.

08:38.690 --> 08:40.149
What can you do now?!

08:40.609 --> 08:41.525
Give me!

08:41.777 --> 08:44.070
Give me back my arms!

08:44.571 --> 08:45.571
My arms!

08:51.119 --> 08:51.882
Arms?

08:52.621 --> 08:54.121
That's it! The arms!

08:59.878 --> 09:02.088
Arima Akira, you're being released.

09:02.422 --> 09:03.252
What about the court case?

09:03.507 --> 09:04.614
He waived it.

09:04.841 --> 09:06.759
The victim withdrew the charges.

09:07.427 --> 09:09.261
Withdrew the charges?

09:09.262 --> 09:10.471
This is unprecedented.

09:10.972 --> 09:12.890
The victim is requesting to see you.

09:12.891 --> 09:13.641
What do you want to do?

09:13.642 --> 09:14.642
Yes!

09:15.060 --> 09:17.144
Please let me see him.

09:31.993 --> 09:34.484
I was a sushi chef.

09:35.080 --> 09:40.584
My dream was to let my mother eat the sushi I made.

09:41.461 --> 09:43.337
I promised her.

09:43.630 --> 09:47.675
I trained for years, and just when
I was able to fulfill that promise...

09:49.094 --> 09:50.761
I lost my arms.

09:52.264 --> 09:53.967
I'm not holding any grudge against you.

09:54.307 --> 09:57.977
But I just can't leave things as they are!

09:58.311 --> 10:00.771
What can I possibly do?

10:05.610 --> 10:07.737
Be my hands.

10:08.530 --> 10:09.655
Your hands?

10:09.656 --> 10:10.281
Please!

10:10.282 --> 10:11.949
I will show you and attend to you constantly.

10:11.950 --> 10:17.413
Be my hands, make my sushi, and let my mother eat it!

10:17.664 --> 10:18.956
Please! I beg you!

10:28.175 --> 10:29.065
Fine.

10:31.428 --> 10:34.180
If these hands are good enough, go ahead.

10:35.182 --> 10:37.932
From now on, these are your hands.

10:47.580 --> 10:49.848
There is no shortcut to making good sushi.

10:49.953 --> 10:54.040
The spices, the rice, and the fish, everything
should be used at their peak condition.

10:54.249 --> 10:56.292
The rest is all about perfecting the skill.

10:56.293 --> 10:56.792
Yeah...

10:56.793 --> 10:58.586
Give a clear answer!

10:58.587 --> 10:59.003
Yes!

11:03.258 --> 11:04.635
Not too much vinegar!

11:04.635 --> 11:05.718
It cools the rice too much!

11:05.719 --> 11:06.385
Right!

11:14.853 --> 11:15.909
Not like that!

11:15.909 --> 11:16.938
How many times do I have to tell you?!

11:17.105 --> 11:20.274
No! When you roll the rice, do it
gently, as if you're rolling air!

11:20.516 --> 11:21.933
No, no, no, no!

11:21.934 --> 11:22.642
No good!

11:22.685 --> 11:24.686
We can't let our customers eat this!

11:24.687 --> 11:25.395
One more time!

11:28.450 --> 11:29.774
Welcome!

11:30.652 --> 11:31.609
Doctor!

11:31.610 --> 11:32.235
Welcome.

11:32.413 --> 11:33.528
I heard it's been tough.

11:34.493 --> 11:35.993
As you see.

11:35.994 --> 11:38.329
I could've done something had I operated on you.

11:38.330 --> 11:39.539
Oh well.

11:40.596 --> 11:41.499
Who's he?

11:42.042 --> 11:43.251
He's an apprentice.

11:43.252 --> 11:45.628
I thought I'd make him the best in Japan.

11:46.004 --> 11:48.044
Akira, this is Dr. Black Jack.

11:48.215 --> 11:50.299
He's a genius.

11:50.300 --> 11:51.217
Hello.

11:51.635 --> 11:53.427
Taku's sushi was second to none.

11:54.346 --> 11:58.015
No ordinary effort will get you to that level.

11:58.475 --> 11:59.028
Right.

12:01.144 --> 12:02.436
Welcome!

12:05.112 --> 12:06.107
Thank you!

12:15.470 --> 12:16.450
Honey.

12:17.077 --> 12:17.952
Ritsuko.

12:17.953 --> 12:20.663
Honey, you will get sick.

12:20.664 --> 12:22.665
You haven't slept much in a few days.

12:23.041 --> 12:25.418
I just want to be useful to him.

12:26.169 --> 12:28.921
I'm starting to get a little more confident.

12:29.381 --> 12:31.549
See? The motion is getting smooth.

12:32.426 --> 12:34.802
These hands will make the best sushi in Japan,

12:34.803 --> 12:36.804
and will feed his mother.

12:38.849 --> 12:39.974
Your hands.

12:41.226 --> 12:42.892
Large, but gentle hands.

12:43.103 --> 12:45.438
I love your hands.

12:45.647 --> 12:47.356
Doesn't it smell like sushi?

12:48.233 --> 12:49.400
It smells like you.

12:51.403 --> 12:52.486
I'm sorry.

12:52.529 --> 12:54.447
I'm sure you're lonely.

12:54.448 --> 12:55.156
I know it.

12:55.908 --> 12:56.828
But it won't be long.

12:57.117 --> 12:58.159
Please be patient.

12:58.160 --> 12:58.868
I will...

12:59.453 --> 13:00.244
Yes.

13:01.421 --> 13:04.200
Noh Sushi

13:44.012 --> 13:44.872
Good!

13:45.082 --> 13:47.458
It's as good as the ones you made, Taku-yan!

13:48.502 --> 13:50.002
You think so too, Master?

13:50.003 --> 13:50.419
Yeah!

13:50.629 --> 13:54.382
There's no shame in having this as the
sushi we serve to the customers.

13:56.510 --> 13:58.219
You did it, partner!

13:58.220 --> 13:59.262
I did it!

14:02.057 --> 14:03.182
Here ya go!

14:03.600 --> 14:06.102
You've really improved.

14:06.103 --> 14:07.478
Can you make me some toro next?

14:07.813 --> 14:09.814
These are Taku-yan's hands.

14:09.898 --> 14:11.190
So ask him.

14:11.692 --> 14:12.900
Taku-yan, give me toro.

14:12.939 --> 14:13.452
Yes, sir!

14:13.612 --> 14:14.377
One toro!

14:14.528 --> 14:15.611
Yes, one toro.

14:16.071 --> 14:17.437
You're good partners.

14:17.823 --> 14:18.948
We're not partners.

14:18.991 --> 14:20.361
Together we are one.

14:20.617 --> 14:21.599
So it is.

14:38.259 --> 14:39.760
Thanks for waiting, Mother.

14:40.289 --> 14:41.262
Please eat.

14:41.388 --> 14:43.014
This is the sushi I made.

14:50.355 --> 14:52.481
It's good.

14:53.442 --> 14:57.236
It really is the best sushi in Japan.

14:57.738 --> 14:59.906
You've done well, Taku.

15:00.324 --> 15:01.365
Mother.

15:03.327 --> 15:05.285
I'm happy for you, Taku-yan.

15:05.495 --> 15:07.496
Thanks. A lot.

15:07.706 --> 15:10.917
I feel a little guilty about tricking your mother.

15:11.168 --> 15:12.293
We didn't trick her.

15:12.377 --> 15:14.962
The sushi you make is my sushi.

15:15.714 --> 15:16.631
You're right.

15:16.882 --> 15:19.029
Work with me from now on, partner.

15:19.218 --> 15:21.084
The same goes for you, partner.

15:26.892 --> 15:30.186
I'm happy that Taku-san's mother liked it too.

15:30.187 --> 15:32.146
It must have been stressful for you as well.

15:32.147 --> 15:32.855
It's okay.

15:32.856 --> 15:35.024
I'm just happy that you're satisfied.

15:36.318 --> 15:38.319
Thanks, Ritsuko.

15:38.737 --> 15:40.696
I could accomplish it because of you.

15:40.781 --> 15:41.531
Thanks so much.

15:43.116 --> 15:43.991
Honey...

15:44.618 --> 15:46.285
I will stay by your side.

15:46.703 --> 15:47.828
Forever.

15:48.914 --> 15:50.164
I'm off now.

15:50.874 --> 15:52.041
See you later.

16:02.344 --> 16:03.094
Hiroshi!

16:03.186 --> 16:03.586
Hiroshi!

16:03.619 --> 16:04.679
Don't go in now!

16:05.472 --> 16:06.389
What's.the matter?

16:06.390 --> 16:08.057
Hiroshi is still inside!

16:08.058 --> 16:08.683
What?!

16:10.936 --> 16:11.644
Hiroshi!

16:13.814 --> 16:15.314
Don't do it!

16:22.072 --> 16:23.197
Where is he?!

16:28.787 --> 16:30.371
You're all right now!

16:44.803 --> 16:46.262
Here comes the baby!

16:46.263 --> 16:47.471
Get the ambulance!

16:47.472 --> 16:48.639
Hurry!

16:59.610 --> 17:02.257
He has severe burns on his back,

17:02.563 --> 17:04.947
and we couldn't treat them.

17:05.496 --> 17:06.109
Honey...

17:07.451 --> 17:09.202
Ri... Ritsuko...

17:09.616 --> 17:10.396
Honey!

17:11.371 --> 17:14.123
How are my hands?

17:14.124 --> 17:14.916
Fine.

17:15.125 --> 17:18.044
They are a little burnt, but they're fine.

17:18.879 --> 17:19.921
Good.

17:21.298 --> 17:26.260
If ill die, give them to Taku-yan.

17:28.013 --> 17:29.513
What are you talking about?

17:29.514 --> 17:31.265
You won't die.

17:31.642 --> 17:32.808
You're right.

17:39.107 --> 17:40.107
Honey...

17:40.734 --> 17:41.484
No...

17:41.735 --> 17:43.965
You just told me that you'd stay by my side forever!

17:44.488 --> 17:46.113
Together forever!

17:46.448 --> 17:47.823
You told me so!

17:53.622 --> 17:54.830
This can't be...

17:56.375 --> 17:57.833
Open your eyes.

17:57.876 --> 17:58.761
My hands.

17:58.961 --> 18:00.002
My partner!

18:00.337 --> 18:02.004
Please! Wake up!

18:02.297 --> 18:03.798
Tell me this is a lie!

18:04.925 --> 18:06.342
Akira!

18:08.887 --> 18:12.348
We are operating on the humeral transplant.

18:13.267 --> 18:14.475
Inject protein.

18:14.518 --> 18:15.115
Yes.

18:15.561 --> 18:17.353
It was his will.

18:17.521 --> 18:19.689
He asked you about it, Dr. Black Jack.

18:20.732 --> 18:23.818
Please give my husband's hands to Taku-san!

18:24.194 --> 18:27.989
Attaching someone's hands to someone
else is an extremely complex operation.

18:27.990 --> 18:29.080
It will cost you.

18:29.283 --> 18:32.285
No matter how much it costs, I will pay for it.

18:33.036 --> 18:35.746
It was my husband's last wish.

18:38.126 --> 18:40.112
Operation in progress

18:42.713 --> 18:44.672
It's impossible to transplant both arms.

18:44.673 --> 18:45.256
I know.

18:45.257 --> 18:47.174
I'm sure there will be a severe rejection.

18:48.302 --> 18:49.135
Taku-yan!

18:51.054 --> 18:53.306
Seperate the blood vessels after the double clamping.

18:53.515 --> 18:55.433
Then suture the nerves and vessels.

18:55.434 --> 18:55.933
Yes.

18:56.727 --> 18:58.769
I will handle the rest.

19:26.632 --> 19:28.132
Operative procedure complete.

19:40.020 --> 19:41.020
It's done.

19:46.860 --> 19:47.860
They're attached!

19:48.281 --> 19:49.737
Will they move, Doctor?

19:49.988 --> 19:52.949
They will move after gradual rehabilitation.

19:53.312 --> 19:54.242
Doctor...

19:54.243 --> 19:57.703
If you want to say thank you, tell
it to the hands' wife over there.

19:57.955 --> 19:58.996
Honey...

19:59.790 --> 20:02.375
Honey, you're here.

20:03.001 --> 20:04.168
You're alive.

20:04.959 --> 20:05.661
Good.

20:05.921 --> 20:06.879
I'm so glad!

20:07.256 --> 20:12.301
Taku, we'll call it even between the
operation fee and your good sushi.

20:13.579 --> 20:14.554
Doctor...

20:15.180 --> 20:16.847
Thank you, madam.

20:17.724 --> 20:20.768
No problem. May I come see them sometime?

20:21.478 --> 20:23.229
His hands?

20:23.647 --> 20:25.356
Of course, anytime.

20:26.275 --> 20:28.609
Come anytime.

20:31.989 --> 20:33.030
Welcome!

20:33.657 --> 20:34.991
Oh, Doctor.

20:35.075 --> 20:36.617
How are the arms?

20:36.869 --> 20:39.829
They are nearly as good as they were before.

20:39.997 --> 20:42.623
I want the eggs you made!

20:42.624 --> 20:45.014
Pinoco, Taku is still in the middle of rehabilitation.

20:45.014 --> 20:47.326
But I want them!

20:47.385 --> 20:48.796
Oh, man.
I want them!

20:49.047 --> 20:50.631
Taku-yan, go ahead.

20:50.632 --> 20:52.008
This is comeback number 1 for you.

20:52.259 --> 20:53.509
Are you sure?

20:53.635 --> 20:54.552
Yeah.

20:54.553 --> 20:57.138
She'll be happy to see that too.

20:58.307 --> 20:59.557
Egg!

20:59.683 --> 21:00.766
Egg!

21:01.226 --> 21:01.995
Sure thing!

21:02.102 --> 21:02.894
One moment please!

21:02.895 --> 21:04.270
Yay!

21:04.271 --> 21:08.441
Taku, if you want, we can remove those burn marks.

21:09.109 --> 21:11.819
No, these are Akira-san's marks.

21:12.613 --> 21:15.990
I will live with his deeds.

21:16.617 --> 21:17.700
Here ya go!

21:25.876 --> 21:28.002
It's still good!

21:28.295 --> 21:30.757
It is better than before!

21:30.923 --> 21:33.758
Well, sure! It's.made with the heart of two people!

21:33.759 --> 21:35.426
So it'll cost you twice as much, too!

21:36.595 --> 21:38.288
He got you, Pinoco.

21:38.288 --> 21:40.042
That's expensive.

21:41.850 --> 21:43.309
Oh, I was just kidding!

21:43.310 --> 21:44.185
Just a joke!

21:44.186 --> 21:45.186
Oh, fine!

21:45.187 --> 21:46.145
Oh, fine!

21:53.362 --> 21:54.975
I'll take eggs next!

21:55.069 --> 21:55.863
And more eggs!

21:55.919 --> 21:56.639
Hey, hey!

21:56.739 --> 21:57.739
Sure thing!

22:07.086 --> 22:19.041
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.086 --> 22:19.041
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.159 --> 22:24.158
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.159 --> 22:24.158
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.727 --> 22:31.196
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.727 --> 22:31.196
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.740 --> 22:37.198
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.740 --> 22:37.198
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.802 --> 22:40.287
being heated up by you,

22:37.802 --> 22:40.287
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.496 --> 22:48.273
so much that I change color

22:40.496 --> 22:48.273
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.358 --> 23:00.127
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.358 --> 23:00.127
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.335 --> 23:12.066
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.335 --> 23:12.066
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.306 --> 23:23.657
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.306 --> 23:23.657
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.843 --> 23:28.764
I couldn't be happier

23:23.843 --> 23:28.764
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.992 --> 23:33.926
How does it taste?

23:28.992 --> 23:33.925
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.078 --> 24:15.064
Moraimizu

23:47.034 --> 23:48.714
I'm sorry every time.

23:50.261 --> 23:52.763
This is called a kendama.

23:52.889 --> 23:54.932
I absolutely refuse to double up!

23:55.475 --> 23:56.892
Yuichi...

23:57.261 --> 23:58.102
Come on, Largo!

24:01.773 --> 24:05.317
This is what happens when you think
only about your job and yourself!

24:06.538 --> 24:09.004
Grow up to be a kind,
generous person.

24:09.418 --> 24:10.731
Who are you?

24:11.511 --> 24:13.732
Next Karte - Moraimizu

24:15.703 --> 24:17.496
Pinoco's Diary...

24:19.827 --> 24:20.653
Doctor...

24:20.733 --> 24:24.200
If you want to say thank you, tell
it to the hands' wife over there.
